  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.3.0: AllowMultiple attributes (register one class against multiple explicit types), DuplicateStrategy enum (Add/Skip/Replace) on [Scoped]/[Singleton]/[Transient], new [TryScoped]/[TrySingleton]/[TryTransient] attributes for library authors, Roslyn diagnostics AW001 (abstract class) and AW002 (duplicate non-keyed service). 1.2.0: Open generic support (typeof(IRepo<>) syntax) + AutoWireOptions(MethodName) for test project collision avoidance. 1.0.0: Initial release with [Scoped], [Singleton], [Transient], keyed services (.NET 8+).",
